## 1. Definitions

For the purpose of this License:

1. **“AIDDM”** refers to the AI Document-Driven Methodology, including all concepts, workflows, specifications, schemas, templates, meta-models, naming conventions, traceability rules, and development guidelines created by the Licensor.

2. **“Software”** means all AIDDM-related source code, binaries, libraries, scripts, and components, including but not limited to:
   - AIDDM CE SDK  
   - AIDoC Tools  
   - AIDDM Parser / Meta-Model Engine  
   - MCP Server and MCP Pipeline  
   - AIDeC Cloud Platform Components  
   - AIDeP Marketplace Infrastructure  
   - AIDeM Migration Tools  
   - AIDeE Estimation Engine  
   - Free / Pro / Enterprise Plugins  
   - Any other modules, utilities, or tools provided by the Licensor.

3. **“Documentation”** means all AIDDM template files, specifications, manuals, examples, reference materials, including SRS/SAS/SDS/STS/VDP/TR/ACR templates and meta-model definitions.

4. **“Generated Output”** means any documents, diagrams, models, metadata, reports, or code produced using the Software, Documentation, or AIDDM methodology.

5. **“Licensor”** refers to **Tsai Spark**, the creator and exclusive owner of all AIDDM intellectual property.

6. **“Licensee”** refers to the individual, company, or entity granted limited rights under this License.

